{
 "total": 117.097,
 "voice": "long-ramayana-hisaab/ch6/voice.wav",
 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.229,
   "text": "Chapter paanch. Chaar hazaar crore ka sach.",
   "end": 3.18
  },
  {
   "start": 3.18,
   "text": "Ab doosra sawaal. Producer Namit Malhotra ne ek podcast mein khud kaha tha: Ramayana ke dono parts ka budget $500 million hai, yaani lagbhag 4,000 crore. Business Today ke mutabik isme promotion bhi shaamil hai. Part one ka alag kharcha public nahi hai.",
   "end": 20.921
  },
  {
   "start": 20.921,
   "text": "Scale samjho: Chandrayaan three mission lagbhag 615 crore ka tha. Ramayana ka budget saadhe chhe Chandrayaan jitna hai.",
   "end": 28.594
  },
  {
   "start": 28.94,
   "text": "Ab sabse zaroori baat. 1,483 crore producer ki jeb mein nahi jaate. Ek sau rupaye ka ticket lo. Is film ke data mein gross aur net ka farak dekho to lagbhag 16 rupaye tax mein jaate hain. Bache lagbhag 84 mein se, aam taur pe theatre lagbhag aadha rakhta hai, pehle hafte thoda kam, baad mein zyada. Yaani sau ke ticket pe film wale ke haath lagbhag 40 se 42 rupaye. Videsh mein bhi film wale ko aam taur pe gross ka lagbhag 40 pratishat milta hai. Ye industry ka rough rule hai, har deal alag hoti hai.",
   "end": 60.601
  },
  {
   "start": 61.113,
   "text": "Ab beech wale case pe ye rule lagao. India net 1,180 ka lagbhag 45 pratishat, lagbhag 530 crore. Videsh ke lagbhag 660 crore ka 40 pratishat, lagbhag 265 crore. Theatre se film wale tak lagbhag 800 crore.",
   "end": 75.578
  },
  {
   "start": 75.917,
   "text": "Phir OTT. Report ke mutabik makers ne dono filmon ke liye 700 crore ka offer thukra diya tha, aur lagbhag ek hazaar crore chahte hain. Agar ek hazaar mila, to Part one ke hisse lagbhag 500 . Satellite aur music ke number public nahi hain, isliye humne nahi jode.",
   "end": 90.679
  },
  {
   "start": 91.22,
   "text": "Total: Part one se lagbhag 1,300 crore. Agar chaar hazaar ka budget dono filmon mein aadha-aadha maano, to Part one ka hissa 2,000 hota hai.",
   "end": 99.617
  },
  {
   "start": 99.617,
   "text": "To jawab: abhi nahi. Part one akela poora paisa wapas nahi laayega. Lekin ye uska kaam tha bhi nahi. Chaar hazaar crore do filmon ka daav hai. Part one ne Part two ke liye audience bana di hai. Asli hisaab Diwali 2027 mein Part two ke baad poora hoga.",
   "end": 115.685
  }
 ],
